<li>Berlayar ke Tiongkok (lewat Tanjung Harapan Baik) naik kapal Lammermuir bersama Maria dan empat anak mereka, 26 Mei 1866 dari East India Docks, London Kapal Lammermuir tiba tanggal 29 September 1866 di Shanghai, Tiongkok</li>
<li>Settled with the Lammermuir Party, December 1866 in 1 Xin Kai Long (New Lane), Hangzhou, Zhejiang</li>
<li>Maria Hudson Taylor lahir tanggal 3 February 1867 in 1 Xin Kai Long (New Lane), Hangzhou</li>
<li>Daughter Grace Dyer Taylor died 23 August 1867 di a temple at Pengshan, near Hangzhou</li>
